    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38118" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανα-πλέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put to sea against,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἀργυρολογίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					4.8.35
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sail back again,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				56.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.28.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rise to the surface</i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαναπλέει ὑμῖν ἔπεα κακά</span> ill language
				<i>rises to</i> your <i>tongue,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.212
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.174
			</span></i>.</div>
